 t side exit Downsview Park Station 12 PM\nCatch 4 PM ferry to Wards Island
  Beach\nRide to Centre Island then Hanlan's point nude beach\nFrom Hanlan'
 s point\, catch 6 PM ferry back to the mainland\n\nRoute Map:\nhttps://www
 .komoot.com/tour/2962923492
