SUMMARY:Waterfront Ride to Grand Opening of Jim Tovey Lakeview Conservatio
 n Area
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Bike Meetup\nJoin us on a relaxed waterfront ride of T
 oronto's west end into the edge of Mississauga to explore [Jim Tovey Lakev
 iew Conservation Area](https://trca.ca/conservation/infrastructure-project
 s/jim-tovey-lakeview-conservation-area/)\, the new 26 hectare waterfront p
 ark in the Greater Toronto Area that opens on May 30th\, "after more than 
 a decade of planning\, collaboration and community vision".\n\n9:30am meet
  on the Humber Bay Bridge\n9:45am depart on group ride\n10:00-10:10am grou
 p gathers at western edge of Colonel Sam Smith Park\n10:30am arrival at Ji
 m Tovey Lakeview Conservation Area\n10:30-11:15am group and individual exp
 loration of Conservation Area\n11:30 return group ride\n12:00pm arrival ba
 ck at Humber Bay Bridge\n12:00-1:00pm optional social (food\, drinks\, ice
  cream) on Marine Parade Drive\n\nCycling distance: approximtely 25km (10.
 7km in each direction plus a small distance within Jim Tovey Lakeview Cons
 ervation Area)\n\nTerrain: paved multi-use trail\, residential roads\, and
  hard-packed gravel trail\n\nSuitable bikes: city\, commuter\, hybrid\, gr
 avel\, MTB\, and road with thicker tires\n\nHelmet: highly recommended!\n\
 nBring: a bike in working order\, plenty of water\, sunglasses\, sunscreen
 \, snacks\, and good vibes!\n\nEvent info:\nhttps://cvc.ca/conversations/g
 rand-opening-jim-tovey-lakeview-conservation-area/\nhttps://cvc.ca/discove
 r-the-new-jim-tovey-lakeview-conservation-area/\n\nProject info:\nhttps://
 trca.ca/conservation/infrastructure-projects/jim-tovey-lakeview-conservati
 on-area/\n\nNews coverage:\nhttps://www.cbc.ca/news/canada/toronto/jim-tov
 ey-lakeview-conservation-area-mississauga-9.7191853\nhttps://www.insauga.c
 om/heres-when-huge-new-conservation-area-opens-to-the-public-in-mississaug
 a/
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/torontobikemeetup/events/314795923/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260515T024934Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260515T024934Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
